        {
          "name": "comment",
          "value": "<p><strong>PURPOSE</strong></p><p>Marks an order as \"Validation Failed\" when one or more required billing fields are missing or invalid. Signals that automated processing cannot continue and human intervention is required.</p><p><strong>WHAT THIS WORKFLOW DOES</strong></p><p>1. Re-fetch the Order</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;Pulls the latest order details from Salesforce.</p><p>2. Prepare the Data</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;Reshapes the Salesforce response into the flat structure used by the orders table.</p><p>3. Apply Status</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;Sets the order's status field to \"Validation Failed\".</p><p>4. Update Database</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;Saves the change so the dashboard immediately shows the failed validation.</p><p><strong>WHEN IT RUNS</strong></p><p>Triggered when the Validate Invoicing Fields workflow returns all_fields_ok = false.</p><p><strong>OUTCOME</strong></p><p>Terminal state — the order will not move forward until the missing or invalid data is corrected in Salesforce and the order is re-submitted into the review flow.</p>",
          "widget": "textarea_rich"
        }
      ],
      "engine": "scala,pyspark,polars,agent",
